      "descriptions": {
        "shortDescriptionText": "<p>Discover an interactive wonderland where cyber drivers experience the fusion of Chevrolet vehicles with cutting-edge technology from the world of TRON.</p>",
        "shortDescriptionMobileText": "Discover an interactive wonderland where cyber drivers  experience the fusion of Chevrolet vehicles with cutting-edge technology from the world of TRON."
      },
      "entityCards": [
        {
          "cardType": "StoryCard",
          "cardData": [
            {
              "header": "Explore the Grid",
              "text": "<p>One small step for car design, one giant leap for virtual vehicles! Enter a state-of-the-art digital arena where Guests can invent, compete and push the limits of terrestrial science with next generation vehicles.</p>\n<p>Inspired by the inventor Sam Flynn, Chevrolet engineers made it possible to bring TRON technology off the Grid and into our world. They’ve developed the Gridiron - a computer system that allows Users to create cutting-edge vehicles, replicate physical environments and experience performance without real-world prototyping.</p>\n<p>The TRON Realm, Chevrolet Digital Challenge is your portal into the world of TRON, where impossible challenges connect with reality in 3 unique interactive zones!</p>\n<p><strong>Create Zone</strong>\n<br />\nThe signature design experience, Advanced Vehicle Design, allows guests to design one-of-a-kind cars and see their dream machines materialize on an overhead display called the “Hypervisor.” Look to <em>Qing Yi</em> - a dynamic Light Runner-style ride that’s the star of the show - for inspiration.</p>\n<p><strong>Imagine Zone</strong>\n<br />\nSwipe your unique Identity Disc in one of 10 “Equipment Evolution” stations to gather and evolve technologies that power up other activities. In “Rez Up!” try on a specially designed Light Suit to connect with <em>Ling Si</em>, Chevrolet’s vision for a new class of intelligent electric vehicles. Advanced technology automates driving, parking and retrieval—look inside the car to find a very familiar face!</p>\n<p><strong>Drive Zone</strong>\n<br />\nTake a virtual spin on one of TRON’s most tricked-out dream rides and accept the “Ultimate Challenge” of the TRON system, on or off the Grid. From the cockpit of a Chevrolet-inspired “Drive Pod,” race past opponents remotely via a driving simulator that puts your senses to the test.\n<br />\nStill feel the need for hyper-speed? Get up close and photo-ready with <em>Guang Suo</em>, a supersonic, light jet-propelled cruiser that’s big on speed, power and performance.</p>",
              "media": [
                {
                  "type": "image/jpeg",
                  "title": "",
                  "url": "https://static.shanghaidisneyresort.com/tridion/prod/en/system/images/shdr-att-tron-realm-chevrolet-digital-challenge-01-new-again_tcm1871-102745.jpg",
                  "width": 170,
                  "height": 96
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "cardType": "buttonCard",
          "cardData": [
            {
              "header": "TRON Lightcycle Power Run – Presented by Chevrolet",
              "text": "<p>Experience high-speed thrills ‘n’ chills as the Grid comes alive in a pulse-pounding race for survival when you enter the cyber-fi world of TRON!</p>",
              "media": [
                {
                  "type": "image/jpeg",
                  "title": "",
                  "url": "https://static.shanghaidisneyresort.com/tridion/prod/en/system/images/shdr-att-tron-realm-chevrolet-digital-challenge-02-new_tcm1871-102746.jpg",
                  "width": 170,
                  "height": 96
                }
              ],
              "buttonCardUrl": "https://www.shanghaidisneyresort.com/en/experience/attraction/tron-lightcycle-power-run"
            }
          ]
        }
